`StringBuilder` is a mutable sequence of characters; `String` is immutable. What does this program print?

```java
public class Main {
    static void grow(StringBuilder sb, String s) {
        sb.append("!");
        s = s + "!";
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder("hi");
        String s = "hi";
        grow(sb, s);
        System.out.println(sb + " " + s);
    }
}
```

